(hierarchical_label "H2" (shape passive) (at 128.27 124.46 270) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right)) (uuid "c8c413c8-33ec-4d3a-953f-890529ab585a"))
(text "NAND2_J2: Y = ~(A & B). One 6Zh2B (6Ж2Б), dual-control pentode: A on g1, B on g3 (suppressor).\nInputs A, B: LV level (1 = +10 V, 0 = -20 V). Output Y: HV level on the plate (1 = +150 V, 0 = +50 V).\nRa 15k, screen Rg2 15k from +150 V (Ug2 <= 96 V while conducting, 150 V cut off),\nCb 15 pF holds g3 against the plate fall through Cg3a (Miller kick while B is high).\nSimulated: Y = 145 V (1), 44...56 V (0); Ik <= 12.6 mA, Pg2 0.37 W; fanout 2/10: tpHL 171/377 ns, tpLH 134/467 ns.\nEach HV net that drives grids needs one divider HV -> LV: 470k || C1 from the net to the LV net, 200k to -50 V,\nC1 = 3.9 pF per g1 grid + 6.8 pF per g3 grid on that net (see NAND2_J2_tb). Inputs only from such a divider.\nUnused input: tie it to the other input. Supplies: +150 V, -50 V (dividers only), heater 6.3 V 0.2 A on H1/H2.\nPage: doc/nand2_j2_6zh2b.md" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 45.72 152.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "453365cc-80b5-4e2f-befe-e023527c4de2"))

